    '|a||Building Russian words: решение, радость, помощник':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6600
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Add -ние, -ость or -ник to a Russian word you know and you get a new one: реше́ние, ра́дость, помо́щник.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9360
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:y5dbg8'
    '|a||How does Russian build new words from words you know? Янва́рь, Петербу́рг. Су́здаль was cold, но всё-таки краси́во.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10960
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||А Ма́ша опя́ть на рабо́те: она́ экскурсово́д в музе́е.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4560
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:uwh0l7'
    '|a||Ве́чером она́ звони́т мне. Послу́шайте.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:zlteu'
    '|b||За́втра у меня́ экску́рсия для ученико́в. Ты мо́жешь быть мои́м помо́щником?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4560
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:16zcgr0'
    '|a||С ра́достью! А что на́до де́лать?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2960
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Объясня́ть де́тям зада́ния. Вот объясне́ние, на бума́ге.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4240
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Хорошо́. Э́то несло́жно!':
